featurewiz
----------
This project re-implements, for teaching purposes, the SULOV and Recursive
XGBoost feature-selection methods of featurewiz (https://github.com/AutoViML/featurewiz),
Copyright Ram Seshadri / AutoViML, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
SULOV ("Searching for Uncorrelated List Of Variables") was created by Ram Seshadri in 2018.
The reference_*.json files record the output of running featurewiz 0.6.1 on the
datasets described in this project.

Breast Cancer Wisconsin (Diagnostic)
------------------------------------
Wolberg, W., Mangasarian, O., Street, N., & Street, W. (1993). UCI Machine Learning
Repository. https://doi.org/10.24432/C5DW2B. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.

breast_cancer.csv is a modified version of the UCI file wdbc.data. Changes:
- the id column was dropped;
- a header row was added, naming the 30 measurements <measure>_<mean|se|worst> with
  underscores instead of spaces (e.g. concave_points_mean for "concave points");
- diagnosis was recoded from letters to integers: M = 1 (malignant), B = 0 (benign),
  and moved to the last column.
